  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Heat oil, add hash browns, onion and peppers. Cook till potatoes begin to brown. Grease  9 x 9 baking dish. Spread potato mixture in pan, top with cooked sausage or ham. Pour beaten eggs over all and season with salt and pepper and garlic. Gently stir to coat all ingredients with eggs. Sprinkle with cheese. Can refrigerate overnight and then bake.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake uncovered at 375 degrees for 35 to 40 minutes. Makes 4 servings. Enjoy.",
      "group": null
    }
